title ALES61 — Lotus's attack/release downward expander: the expander given a sense of time
prompt recur the itinerary Lindy-first crux-first after ALES60; take the next agent-doable Lotus lap, send it as its own signed round, stop at custody gates
think ALES60 completed the dynamics quartet (compressor, limiter, gate, expander) but the expander was the only member still instantaneous — the compressor, gate, and limiter each earned their attack/release form (ALES53-55) by driving their gain from ALES52's proven envelope follower. Crux-first, the tightest next move is to give the expander the same breath so the whole family shares one time base.
think The rung mirrors ALES54 (attack/release gate) line for line, with the gate's below-threshold DIVISION replaced by the expander's below-threshold WIDENING. Same expand_follow / expand_follow_carry pair sharing one implementation, same ExpandEnvError faults, same per-sample envelope.env_step advance. The one changed step: when the smoothed envelope e < thr, the target is ALES60's exp = max(0, thr - (thr-e)*num/den), and the gain exp/e is applied to the raw sample.
think Proved the gain sits in [0,1] before coding: num/den >= 1 forces the widened deficit >= (thr-e), so exp <= thr-(thr-e) = e, and it is floored at 0 — so exp in [0,e], gain in [0,1], the magnitude only ever shrinks. A zero envelope means a zero sample (env_step forces a unit step toward any nonzero target), so no divide by zero. Overflow: (thr-e)*num <= 32767*2^32 fits i64; m*exp <= 32768*32767 fits i64.
think Witness mirrors ALES54's seven clauses: silence; unit attack/release reduces to the plain ALES60 expander byte-for-byte (the zero-smoothing limit, both tools run); unit ratio identity; sign held / magnitude never expands; a slower release eases the widening longer (monotone, the first tail sample strictly louder); state carries across a split; each fault refuses by name. It re-proves ALES60 and ALES52 beside it so the rung rests on both parents.
think Monotonic stamp: live clock read 20260814.183555 (TZ=America/New_York), after ALES60's 183030 — later-is-larger holds.
obs GREEN on the first build; the ALES54 idiom carried over clean with only the gain law swapped. tame_style_check bans clean, >=2 asserts per fn each with a positive // invariant:. The whole dynamics family now shares ALES52's one time base across all four members. Purely local — no lookahead, socket, network, keys, funds, device, or sample rate; every custody gate untouched.
